<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0c10">
  <meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style" content="black-translucent">
  <meta name="apple-mobile-web-app-title" content="AI Hub">
  <link rel="manifest" href="manifest.json">
  <link rel="icon" href="icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="icon.svg">
  <title>Willian AI Hub • Dev, WhatsApp & Insta</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0b0c10;
      --panel: #13151c;
      --panel-2: #1a1d27;
      --border: #262a38;
      --text: #f3f4f6;
      --muted: #9ca3af;
      --accent: #6366f1;
      --accent-2: #8b5cf6;
      --wa: #16a34a;
      --ig: #e11d48;
      --gold: #fbbf24;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
    body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); height: 100dvh; display: flex; overflow: hidden; }

    /* BARRA LATERAL ESQUERDA */
    .sidebar {
      width: 315px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      height: 100%;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      z-index: 30;
      transition: transform 0.25s ease;
    }
    .icon-rail {
      width: 52px;
      background: #0e1016;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 12px 0;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .rail-btn {
      width: 36px;
      height: 36px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .rail-btn:hover, .rail-btn.active {
      background: var(--panel-2);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .rail-sep { width: 24px; height: 1px; background: var(--border); margin: 4px 0; }

    .drawer-content {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 12px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .search-box {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .search-box input {
      background: transparent;
      border: none;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 13px;
      width: 100%;
      outline: none;
    }
    .filter-tabs {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      padding-bottom: 2px;
    }
    .filter-tab {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 99px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .filter-tab.active {
      background: var(--panel-2);
      color: #fff;
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .model-list {
      flex: 1;
      overflow-y: auto;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      padding-right: 2px;
    }
    .model-item {
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 10px;
      padding: 9px 10px;
      text-align: left;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .model-item:hover { background: var(--panel-2); }
    .model-item.selected {
      background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.14);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    .model-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; min-width: 0; }
    .provider-badge {
      width: 28px;
      height: 28px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #fff;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .model-info { min-width: 0; }
    .model-name {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fff;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .model-desc {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .tag {
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 3px 6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .tag-frontier { background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2); color: #c4b5fd; border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); }
    .tag-dev { background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2); color: #93c5fd; border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.4); }
    .tag-free { background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.2); color: #86efac; border: 1px solid rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.4); }

    .sidebar-footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding-top: 10px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .btn-side {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 9px 10px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--panel-2);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .btn-side-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), var(--accent-2));
      border: none;
    }
    .btn-side-install {
      background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.18);
      border-color: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.5);
      color: #4ade80;
    }

    /* ÁREA PRINCIPAL */
    .main {
      flex: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      height: 100%;
      min-width: 0;
      background: var(--bg);
    }
    .topbar {
      height: 54px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 12px;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .top-left { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
    .menu-toggle {
      display: none;
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #fff;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .active-model-pill {
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 99px;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 700;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    .nav-modes {
      display: flex;
      gap: 5px;
      background: var(--bg);
      padding: 4px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .mode-btn {
      border: none;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 6px 9px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .mode-btn.active { background: var(--panel-2); color: #fff; }
    .mode-btn.active[data-mode="wa"] { background: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.25); color: #4ade80; }
    .mode-btn.active[data-mode="ig"] { background: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.25); color: #fda4af; }

    /* FAIXA DE INSTALAÇÃO NO CELULAR */
    .install-banner {
      display: none;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #1e1b4b, #312e81);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .install-banner.show { display: flex; }
    .install-banner button {
      background: #22c55e;
      color: #052e16;
      border: none;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 6px 11px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* PAINÉIS DE CONTEÚDO */
    .view { display: none; flex: 1; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }
    .view.active { display: flex; }

    /* CHAT */
    .quick-prompts {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: #0e1016;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .qp-chip {
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #d1d5db;
      font-size: 11px;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 99px;
      cursor: pointer;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .qp-chip:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: #fff; }

    .chat-messages {
      flex: 1;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 14px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    .msg {
      max-width: 88%;
      padding: 11px 13px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      word-wrap: break-word;
    }
    .msg-user {
      align-self: flex-end;
      background: var(--accent);
      color: #fff;
      border-bottom-right-radius: 4px;
    }
    .msg-ai {
      align-self: flex-start;
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--text);
      border-bottom-left-radius: 4px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 680px;
    }
    .msg-meta {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--gold);
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .msg-body pre {
      background: #08090d;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow-x: auto;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace;
      font-size: 12px;
      margin: 8px 0;
      color: #a5b4fc;
    }
    .msg-body code { font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); padding: 1px 4px; border-radius: 4px; }
    .msg-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 9px;
      padding-top: 8px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .act-btn {
      background: var(--panel-2);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #e5e7eb;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 5px 9px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .act-btn-wa { border-color: rgba(22, 163, 74, 0.5); color: #4ade80; }
    .act-btn-ig { border-color: rgba(225, 29, 72, 0.5); color: #fda4af; }

    .chat-input-bar {
      padding: 10px 12px;
      background: var(--panel);
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: flex-end;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .chat-input-bar textarea {
      flex: 1;
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #fff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      font-size: 14px;
      resize: none;
      max-height: 120px;
      min-height: 42px;
      outline: none;
    }
    .chat-input-bar textarea:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }
    .icon-btn {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 11px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--panel-2);
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 16px;
      cursor: pointer;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .send-btn {
      background: var(--accent);
      border: none;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    /* ESTÚDIOS WHATSAPP & INSTAGRAM */
    .studio-scroll {
      flex: 1;
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 14px;
      max-width: 680px;
      width: 100%;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }
    .card {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .card h3 { font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    .label { display: block; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); margin: 10px 0 5px; }
    .input, .select, .textarea {
      width: 100%;
      background: var(--bg);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      font-size: 14px;
      outline: none;
    }
    .textarea { min-height: 90px; resize: vertical; line-height: 1.4; }
    .btn-full {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 12px;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 10px;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      margin-top: 10px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .btn-wa { background: var(--wa); }
    .btn-ig { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e11d48, #9333ea); }
    .btn-ai { background: var(--accent); }
    .btn-dark { background: var(--panel-2); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .row { display: flex; gap: 8px; }
    .status-msg { font-size: 12px; color: var(--gold); text-align: center; margin-top: 8px; }

    /* MODAL DE CONFIGURAÇÃO */
    .modal-backdrop {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.75);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px;
      z-index: 50;
    }
    .modal-backdrop.open { display: flex; }
    .modal {
      background: var(--panel);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 16px;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 440px;
      max-height: 90dvh;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      z-index: 25;
    }
    .overlay.show { display: block; }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .sidebar {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        bottom: 0;
        left: 0;
        transform: translateX(-100%);
      }
      .sidebar.open { transform: translateX(0); }
      .menu-toggle { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="overlay" id="overlay" onclick="toggleSidebar(false)"></div>

  <!-- PAINEL LATERAL MULTIMODELOS -->
  <aside class="sidebar" id="sidebar">
    <div class="icon-rail">
      <button class="rail-btn active" title="Todos" onclick="filterByProvider('all', this)">⚡</button>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="Anthropic Claude" onclick="filterByProvider('Anthropic', this)">A\</button>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="Google Gemini" onclick="filterByProvider('Google', this)">✦</button>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="OpenAI" onclick="filterByProvider('OpenAI', this)">◎</button>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="DeepSeek" onclick="filterByProvider('DeepSeek', this)">🐋</button>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="xAI Grok" onclick="filterByProvider('xAI', this)">Ø</button>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="GLM & Kimi" onclick="filterByProvider('Open', this)">⌘</button>
      <div class="rail-sep"></div>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="WhatsApp Hub" onclick="switchMode('wa'); toggleSidebar(false);">🟢</button>
      <button class="rail-btn" title="Instagram Studio" onclick="switchMode('ig'); toggleSidebar(false);">📸</button>
    </div>

    <div class="drawer-content">
      <div class="search-box">
        <span>🔍</span>
        <input type="text" id="modelSearch" placeholder="Modelos de pesquisa..." oninput="renderModels()">
      </div>

      <div class="filter-tabs">
        <button class="filter-tab active" onclick="setTab('all', this)">Recomendado</button>
        <button class="filter-tab" onclick="setTab('dev', this)">Dev & Código</button>
        <button class="filter-tab" onclick="setTab('free', this)">Grátis</button>
      </div>

      <div class="model-list" id="modelList"></div>

      <div class="sidebar-footer">
        <button class="btn-side btn-side-install" id="btnInstallSide" onclick="installPWA()">📲 Instalar App na Tela Inicial</button>
        <button class="btn-side" onclick="clearChat()">🗑️ Nova Conversa</button>
        <button class="btn-side btn-side-primary" onclick="openSettings()">⚙️ Chaves API, WhatsApp & Insta</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </aside>

  <!-- ÁREA PRINCIPAL -->
  <main class="main">
    <div class="install-banner" id="installBanner">
      <span>📲 Instale o <strong>AI Hub</strong> como app no seu celular</span>
      <button onclick="installPWA()">Instalar Agora</button>
    </div>

    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="top-left">
        <button class="menu-toggle" onclick="toggleSidebar(true)">☰</button>
        <div class="active-model-pill" onclick="toggleSidebar(true)">
          <span id="topModelBadge">✦</span>
          <span id="topModelName">Gemini 3.8 Flash</span>
          <span style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px;">▼</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="nav-modes">
        <button class="mode-btn active" data-mode="chat" onclick="switchMode('chat')">💬 IA Chat</button>
        <button class="mode-btn" data-mode="ig" onclick="switchMode('ig')">📸 Insta</button>
        <button class="mode-btn" data-mode="wa" onclick="switchMode('wa')">🟢 WhatsApp</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- ABA 1: CHAT DEV & MULTI-IA -->
    <section class="view active" id="view-chat">
      <div class="quick-prompts">
        <button class="qp-chip" onclick="useQuickPrompt('Crie o código completo e limpo para: ')">💻 Gerar Código</button>
        <button class="qp-chip" onclick="useQuickPrompt('Encontre o bug e corrija este código:\n')">🐞 Corrigir Bug</button>
        <button class="qp-chip" onclick="useQuickPrompt('Crie 3 opções de legenda viral para Instagram Reels sobre: ')">📸 Legenda Reels</button>
        <button class="qp-chip" onclick="useQuickPrompt('Escreva uma resposta comercial profissional para enviar no WhatsApp para um cliente que perguntou: ')">🟢 Resposta Cliente</button>
      </div>

      <div class="chat-messages" id="chatMessages"></div>

      <div class="chat-input-bar">
        <button class="icon-btn" id="btnVoiceChat" title="Falar no microfone" onclick="dictateTo('chatInput', this)">🎙️</button>
        <textarea id="chatInput" rows="1" placeholder="Pergunte ao Gemini, Claude, DeepSeek..." onkeydown="handleChatKey(event)"></textarea>
        <button class="icon-btn send-btn" id="btnSendChat" onclick="sendChatMessage()">➤</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ABA 2: ESTÚDIO INSTAGRAM + IA -->
    <section class="view" id="view-ig">
      <div class="studio-scroll">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="color: #fda4af;">📸 Central Instagram + IA</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.4;">
            Gere legendas, roteiros de Reels, sequências de Stories ou respostas de Direct usando a IA selecionada no menu e abra o Instagram com 1 toque.
          </p>

          <label class="label">Tipo de Conteúdo:</label>
          <select class="select" id="igType">
            <option value="Legenda para Reels viral com gancho forte, texto curto, chamada para orçamento no WhatsApp e hashtags locais">🎬 Legenda para Reels Viral</option>
            <option value="Roteiro falado de 20 segundos para Reels mostrando o processo e o resultado final">🎙️ Roteiro Falado para Vídeo</option>
            <option value="Sequência de 4 Stories estratégicos para abrir agenda e gerar pedidos de orçamento">📱 Sequência de 4 Stories que Vendem</option>
            <option value="Resposta simpática e persuasiva para Direct levando o cliente para o WhatsApp">💬 Resposta de Direct (DM)</option>
          </select>

          <label class="label">Sobre o que é a publicação ou mensagem:</label>
          <div class="row">
            <input type="text" class="input" id="igTopic" placeholder="Ex: Fechamento de braço realismo preto e cinza feito hoje">
            <button class="icon-btn" onclick="dictateTo('igTopic', this)">🎙️</button>
          </div>

          <button class="btn-full btn-ai" id="btnGenIg" onclick="generateInstagramPost()">✨ Criar Conteúdo com IA Ativa</button>

          <label class="label">Texto Pronto (edite se quiser):</label>
          <textarea class="textarea" id="igOutput" placeholder="O texto gerado pela IA aparecerá aqui..."></textarea>

          <div class="row">
            <button class="btn-full btn-dark" onclick="copyText('igOutput', 'igStatus')">📋 Copiar Texto</button>
            <button class="btn-full btn-ig" onclick="openInstagramWithText()">📸 Copiar e Abrir Instagram</button>
          </div>
          <div class="status-msg" id="igStatus"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ABA 3: CENTRAL WHATSAPP + IA -->
    <section class="view" id="view-wa">
      <div class="studio-scroll">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 style="color: #4ade80;">🟢 Central WhatsApp + IA</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.4;">
            Cole o que o cliente mandou ou escolha um modelo rápido. A IA escreve a resposta e dispara direto no seu WhatsApp.
          </p>

          <label class="label">Número do Cliente (opcional — deixe vazio para escolher o contato no WhatsApp):</label>
          <input type="tel" class="input" id="waClientPhone" placeholder="Ex: 11999999999">

          <label class="label">Mensagem do Cliente ou Objetivo do Contato:</label>
          <div class="row">
